    {
      "sha": "2bc898efe9ec5e41034dea319a7497b0418f5d80",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Anastasia-Labs/midgard/commit/2bc898efe9ec5e41034dea319a7497b0418f5d80",
      "message": "Document P1 user flows and operational runbooks\n\nCovers deposit and withdrawal milestones, forced-transaction limits,\nevaluate(), the curated operator lifecycle and runbooks for commit lag,\ncatch-up, replay mismatches, forced-admission divergence, follower holds,\nstuck settlements and proof submission deadlines under permissionless\nchallenging.",
