      "message": "Cover every script-integrity role with forged successors and admissible forced rows",
      "authorName": "Philip DiSarro",
      "authorDate": "2026-10-26T08:28:29Z"
    },
    {
      "sha": "a12fa319673b5957349c48d5703a74e5bdc968e9",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Anastasia-Labs/midgard/commit/a12fa319673b5957349c48d5703a74e5bdc968e9",
      "message": "Fit each script-integrity walk page to the transaction budget\n\nThe prover now builds proof-opening pages at the configured maximum and\nhalves them until the evaluated transaction fits, so a deep ledger or\nsource map no longer stalls the walk. A max-shape case over a padded\nledger and source map covers the fitted path through conviction.\nForced fixtures use shapes the forced-transaction admission screen accepts.",
      "authorName": "Philip DiSarro",
      "authorDate": "2026-10-26T08:28:21Z"
    },
    {
      "sha": "3df1a40af62cd5ea58abef44d799965537665b40",
